<h2 class="doc-h2">With Icons</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>IconContent</code> takes the dot's place — a Lucide Icon, an Avatar, anything.
</p>
<Example Source="TimelineIcons.razor"><TimelineIcons /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Animated + ActiveIndex</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>ActiveIndex</code> drives the dots: the active one is filled, everything before it is
    completed. <code>Animated</code> pulses the active dot and retracts the connectors as they
    fill. In this static host the index lives in the URL.
</p>
<Example Source="TimelineActive.razor"><TimelineActive /></Example>

